1. GELLO
--------
   https://github.com/wuphilipp/gello_software
   Copyright (c) 2023 Philipp Wu
   MIT License
   Reference commit: fa0407bb15be5c220f0696823dbc3803a657c9c7 (2026-04-07)

   Used from this project:
     - franka_gello_state_publisher      (leader state publisher, driver replaced)
     - franka_fr3_arm_controllers        (joint impedance controller, 2 fixes applied)
     - franka_gripper_manager            (unmodified)

   The FeetechDriver in driver/driver.py implements the DynamixelDriverProtocol
   interface defined in GELLO's dynamixel/driver.py. The class structure follows that
   file so the driver is interchangeable with the original.

   Modifications are documented in patches/ and are offered back upstream.


2. LeRobot-Anything-U-Arm
-------------------------
   https://github.com/MINT-SJTU/LeRobot-Anything-U-Arm
   MINT-SJTU
   Apache License 2.0
   Reference commit: bd31c691e0818367e93a743bb49be4abaaff8b59 (2026-09-02)
   Paper: arXiv:2509.02437

   Used from this project:
     - mechanical/Feetech_servo/Config3_STL   (printed leader arm frame)
     - src/uarm/scripts/Uarm_teleop/Feetech_servo/scservo_sdk   (Feetech servo SDK)

   The STS3215 control table in driver/sts3215.yaml is generated from the address
   constants in this SDK by driver/gen_sts3215_yaml.py, rather than transcribed by hand.

   No U-Arm ROS 1 node, teleoperation script or follower adapter is used.

   The Apache-2.0 license is declared in the project README. At the reference commit
   the repository does not carry a LICENSE file.


